  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Healthcare for mothers and children in South Sudan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective is to help reduce morbidity and mortality of women of reproductive age, children under 5 years and internally displaced people in remote areas of Bor South County. The expected results are: access  to primary healthcare services , improvement  of health and well being of pregnant women and improvement of nutritional status of children under 5 years of age</narrative>
  </description>
